[00:23.23]1. As we encourage one another
[00:29.18]To serve Jehovah faithfully,
[00:35.13]We find the bonds of love are strengthened;
[00:41.83]Fine works bring peace and unity.
[00:48.52]The love we find among God’s people
[00:55.22]Gives each the courage to endure.
[01:01.92]Our congregation is a refuge,
[01:07.60]A place where we can feel secure.
[01:21.12]2. A word when spoken at the right time
[01:25.12]Is, oh, how comforting to hear!
[01:31.12]We hear these words of consolation
[01:38.59]From friends so faithful and so dear.
[01:44.87]How good it is to work together
[01:51.64]With those whose hopes and goals we share!
[01:57.88]We seek to strengthen one another
[02:04.89]And help each one his burden bear.
[02:29.90]3. As we with eyes of faith are seeing
[02:54.91]The nearness of Jehovah’s day,
[03:01.23]We need our gathering together
[03:07.77]To keep us walking in the way.
[03:14.27]United with Jehovah’s people,
[03:20.92]We hope to serve eternally.
[03:27.16]So we encourage one another
[03:33.79]To hold to our integrity.